```css
body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

header {
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    padding: 15px 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffcc;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

nav a {
    color: #00ffcc;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 20px;
}

nav a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

h1, h2 {
    color: #00ffcc;
}

.review-card {
    background-color: #2a2a2a;
    border: 1px solid #444;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.review-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #ffffff;
}

.rating {
    color: #ffd700;
    font-size: 1.2em;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #00ffcc;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.btn:hover {
    background-color: #00cc99;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #444;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 40px;
}
```

